          "end": 4.59,
          "en": "So what is lazy loading in an Angular app?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.59,
          "end": 7.38,
          "en": "What does this term mean?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.38,
          "end": 8.7,
          "en": "Well, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.7,
          "end": 11.76,
          "en": "it means that you wanna build your app such,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.76,
          "end": 15.42,
          "en": "or you at least want to consider building your app such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.42,
          "end": 20.19,
          "en": "that certain pieces of the overall application code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
