          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.9,
          "end": 33.03,
          "en": "That's what lazy loading means.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.03,
          "end": 37.77,
          "en": "So the idea is that you don't load the entire code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.77,
          "end": 40.47,
          "en": "of the entire application upfront,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.47,
          "end": 44.28,
          "en": "but instead by splitting it into multiple chunks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.28,
          "end": 45.779,
          "en": "that are loaded on demand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.779,
          "end": 48.69,
          "en": "you have the potential advantage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.69,
          "end": 51.69,
          "en": "that you have a smaller initial bundle size,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.69,
          "end": 54.57,
          "en": "which means less code needs to be downloaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.57,
          "end": 57.39,
          "en": "by your website visitors initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.39,
          "end": 61.08,
          "en": "Therefore, hopefully leading to a faster startup time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.08,
          "end": 64.71,
          "en": "and a better user experience whilst of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.71,
          "end": 66.72,
          "en": "making sure that any missing code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.72,
          "end": 69.12,
          "en": "is being downloaded from the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.12,
          "end": 73.62,
          "en": "that's serving the application when it is needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.62,
          "end": 75,
          "en": "So some parts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75,
          "end": 79.08,
          "en": "of the application code are only loaded when",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
