          "en": "they're needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.28,
          "end": 83.46000000000001,
          "en": "That's the idea behind lazy loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 85.71000000000001,
          "en": "and adding it to your application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
